## Changes Applied

### `Optional.get()` → `orElseThrow()` / idiomatic `map()`

| File | What changed |
|---|---|
| `streams/StreamsGroup.java` | Replaced the 4-line `isEmpty()` guard + `.get()` pattern with a one-liner using `topology.get().map(...).orElse(false)` |
| `streams/topics/InternalTopicManager.java` | `topicMetadata.get()` → `topicMetadata.orElseThrow()` inside the non-empty else branch |
| `streams/AssignmentRefinerImpl.java` | `currentOwner.get()` → `currentOwner.orElseThrow()` inside the non-empty else branch |

### Pattern-matching `instanceof` (Java 17+ modules only)

| File | Pairs updated |
|---|---|
| `server-common/.../json/JsonValue.java` | 4 pairs: `asJsonObjectOptional`, `asJsonArrayOptional`, `apply`, `BasicJsonValue.equals` |
| `server-common/.../json/JsonArray.java` | `equals` method |
| `server-common/.../json/JsonObject.java` | `equals` method |
| `group-coordinator/.../assignor/RangeSet.java` | `contains` method |

Pattern matching in `clients/` was attempted but reverted — that module compiles at `-source 11`, and pattern-matching `instanceof` requires Java 16+.

---

**Skipped (rationale):**
- `null`-sentinel in `ConsumerCoordinator` — pattern is consistent across 4 methods in 2 files; changing one alone creates asymmetry
- Broad `catch (Exception)` in `Sender`/`NetworkClient` — intentional resilience design for I/O threads and callback loops
- Assignor builder base-class extraction — algorithms are structurally incompatible; only ~20 lines would be shared
- Large-class splits (`GroupMetadataManager`, `KafkaAdminClient`) — require deep restructuring and full CI validation

